= Stakeholder - Resident with dementia [ST-01] =

//Who is affected. In the Foundation, captured by exactly two things: the values they hold, and their relationship to other Stakeholders. A full behavioral Persona is built later, in the Specification, for Direct Stakeholders only.//

**Report Format:** §1.1 Operational Demands

== Fields ==

|=Field|=Description
|ID|ST-01
|Name|Resident with dementia
|Status|In Progress
|Evidence basis|How this knowledge was obtained — direct observation, interview, literature, secondary data, or proxy informant — flagged as provisional where it rests on anything other than direct contact with the Stakeholder group it describes. For a Measure or Evaluation Method, cite existing use in a validation study or authoritative literature (e.g. a validated-instrument source or textbook) instead.
|Type|Direct
|Values and motivations|(((
- HV-01: Autonomy

- HV-02: Dignity

- HV-03: Privacy

- HV-04: Competence

- HV-05: Well-being
)))
|Relationship to other Stakeholders|Receives support from ST-02 care workers, may have ST-03 family members involved in their care.

